        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG403-630  Contemporary Two Tone Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary designed 9-1/4\" door pull is made of solid stainless steel by AHI Hardware, a leader in stainless door hardware. Two tone finish - bright Polished Stainless grip handle with Satin Stainless ends for a truly eye catching design. The round Polished Stainless grip handle is a comfortable 1\" diameter. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, metal or glass doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-classico-finishes.jpg?v=1704354531\" width=\"400\" height=\"375\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG403 Stainless Door Pull\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the AHI SIG403 Two Tone Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 235 mm (9-1/4\")</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 210 mm (8-1/4\") C/C</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 64 mm (2-1/2\")</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 25 mm (1\") Round</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished/Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Choice:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolt Mounting</b> - bolts through the door (1 pull)</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back mounting</b> - pulls bolt to each other through the door (requires two pulls)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle)</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>**This item is discontinued</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Two Tone Stainless Steel Door Pull, AHI SIG403-630",
                "description": "AHI SIG403-630 Door Pulls. This very contemporary designed 9-1/4 inch door pull is made of solid stainless steel by AHI Hardware, a leader in stainless door hardware. Two tone finish, bright Polished Stainless grip handle with Satin Stainless ends for a truly eye catching design. Packaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts through the door). Optional  Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).",
